Cell["\<\
Structure constants of the small quantum product with at least one identity \
or divisor insertion.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9041896725205994`*^9, 
  3.9041896957478757`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"51fc08ce-2593-4a43-92c5-\
